@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### Get All Event Params
GET {{base_url}}/api/event-params

### Create Event Params
POST {{base_url}}/api/event-params
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gaSessionId": "ga_abc123",
  "eventDate": "2026-01-15",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-01-15T10:30:00",
  "eventName": "page_view",
  "eventParams": "{\"page\": \"/home\", \"duration\": 120}"
}

### Get Event Params by Session ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/event-params/session/ga_abc123